/Title (Using the complete 1,025-observation dataset, the reproduction produced exceptionally high performance. Random Forest, XGBoost, and the Stacking Ensemble achieved 100.00% accuracy and an AUC of 1.0000, compared with the original paper's reported Stacking Ensemble performance of 98.53% accuracy and 0.9880 AUC. The dataset contained 723 duplicate observations, leaving 302 unique observations after exact-record deduplication.)
