/Title (All trained pipelines and experimental outputs were serialised to support reproducibility and inspection. These artefacts allow the experimental results to be verified and reproduced from the submitted project files without re-running the full training procedure.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 815 0 R
>>
endobj
917 0 obj
<<
/Title (2. Single train-test split. A single stratified 80/20 split with fixed seed 42 was used. Repeated stratified splits or repeated cross-validation could provide stronger evidence of performance stability.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 717 0 R
/Prev 816 0 R
/Next 978 0 R
>>
endobj
918 0 obj
<<
/Title (4. Fixed model configurations. Models were evaluated at specified baseline settings rather than through extensive hyperparameter optimisation.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 717 0 R
/Prev 978 0 R
/Next 817 0 R
>>
endobj
919 0 obj
<<
/Title (2. Use group-aware partitioning when repeated observations exist. Methods such as GroupKFold should be considered when patient IDs or other grouping identifiers are available.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 718 0 R
/Prev 818 0 R
/Next 979 0 R
>>
endobj
920 0 obj
<<
